PURPOSE of /kernel/misc/dmesg-check
Description: Check dmesg log after boot for any bugs, errors, or warnings.
Author: William Gomeringer <wgomerin@redhat.com>

Description:

PASS if no bugs found during boot. Warn on warnings and errors. 
The reason for this is that we can get spurious errors, for example:

kernel: ERST: Error Record Serialization Table (ERST) support is initialized.

or harmless warnings. Look at the logs to determine if the warning or error 
is really a bug.

